---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Results">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-16">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Case studies</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8 leading-tight">
        Creativity that <span class="text-indigo-600">delivers</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 font-light">
        I've delivered results for all kinds of clients, from a global entertainment giant to a data-driven finance platform.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-32">
      <!-- Sports -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
          <div class="aspect-square bg-slate-100 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center group">
            <!-- Placeholder for image -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 opacity-90 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10 text-white text-center p-8">
              <span class="block text-7xl font-black mb-4">4M+</span>
              <span class="block text-xl font-medium opacity-90">Paying Guests</span>
              <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-white/50 mx-auto my-6 rounded-full"></div>
              <span class="block text-5xl font-black mb-4">240M</span>
              <span class="block text-xl font-medium opacity-90">Website Views</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-3">Sports</h2>
          <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">Global Lead Copywriter at LIV Golf</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            I played a foundational role in the world's most disruptive sports project. My role spanned everything from brand architecture to event signage, helping establish the league in over 20 different countries.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            Read full case study <span class="ml-2 text-xl">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Business and finance -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-slate-100 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center group">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-400 to-teal-600 opacity-90 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10 text-white text-center p-8">
              <span class="block text-8xl font-black mb-4">15%</span>
              <span class="block text-2xl font-medium opacity-90">Average Open Rate</span>
              <p class="mt-6 text-emerald-50 text-lg">Consistent daily engagement</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-3">Business & Finance</h2>
          <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">Thought Leadership for Stockopedia</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            I have produced a range of thought-leadership content for business and financial brands, channelling my journalistic background to provide original insights for a sophisticated audience.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center text-emerald-600 font-semibold hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            Read full case study <span class="ml-2 text-xl">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Healthcare -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
          <div class="aspect-square bg-slate-100 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center group">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-400 to-orange-500 opacity-90 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10 text-white text-center p-8">
              <span class="block text-7xl font-black mb-4">19</span>
              <span class="block text-2xl font-medium opacity-90">Countries Reached</span>
              <p class="mt-6 text-rose-50 text-lg">International delegates connected</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-3">Healthcare</h2>
          <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">Protect Our Future Too</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            In tandem with The Keenfolks, a digital transformation agency in Barcelona, I led the creation of Protect Our Future Too — a global campaign to protect domestic animals from the effects of climate change.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center text-rose-600 font-semibold hover:text-rose-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            Read full case study <span class="ml-2 text-xl">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AI and machine learning -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-slate-100 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center group">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-bl from-blue-500 to-indigo-800 opacity-90 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
            <div class="relative z-10 text-white text-center p-8">
              <span class="block text-5xl font-black mb-4">Fan Caddie</span>
              <span class="block text-xl font-medium opacity-90">The first chatbot for golf fans</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-3">AI & Machine Learning</h2>
          <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">Native Fluency in Tech</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Before Claude. Before Gemini. Even before ChatGPT, I was covering AI as both a journalist and copywriter, building the knowledge which means I can communicate this topic with native fluency.
          </p>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            Read full case study <span class="ml-2 text-xl">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-32 border-t border-slate-200 pt-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Want results like these?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">Tell me what you're trying to achieve on a free discovery call, and I'll show you exactly how I'd approach it.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@invincibleink.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg text-lg font-bold text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:shadow-indigo-500/30 transition-all hover:scale-105">
        Let's talk results
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
